This project's source is original. It copies no vendor framework, example host or sample
code. The approach draws on public documentation and ideas from:

- Model Context Protocol and the MCP Apps extension (modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps):
  specifications and SDK documentation. The SDKs are used as dependencies, under their own
  licences.
- sunpeak and MCPJam inspector: used for ideas only (testing workflows). No code was copied.

Third-party dependencies in package.json keep their own licences. Their exact licence texts
are to be checked and listed after the first real install (pending).

All data in fixtures/approvals.v1.json is synthetic. No real people, vendors or amounts.
